      <div type="clause" n="4.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 4.6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On suman ealugafol . hede se ðe scire healde þæt he wite a hwæt ealdland ræden sy . 7 hwæt ðeode ðeaw.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In some estates ale-rent. He that would hold a shire should heed that he know what the old estate customs and what the customs of the region are.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[4.6] Hede se ðe scire healde, þæt he wite á, hwæt ealdlandræden sy 7 hwæt ðeode ðeaw.</ab>
      </div>
